  "uncertainty": "As of 2026-10-04, the current FCC profile and May 2026 closing reports supersede the historical Bonneville, Entercom and Inner City ownership evidence. The dossier identifies Connoisseur Media as the acquiring operating group, but does not explicitly document the corporate ownership link from Connoisseur Media Licenses, LLC upward, any intermediate holding companies, or who owns or controls Connoisseur Media. Accordingly, no legal ownership-chain links or ultimate parent are established. Jeff Warshaw is documented as founder and CEO; the additional title of president is not established."
